9.311], ["its", 89.311, 89.435], ["branches", 89.435, 89.827], ["around", 89.827, 90.119], ["me", 90.119, 90.304], ["and", 90.434, 90.526], ["it", 90.526, 90.587], ["looked", 90.587, 90.772], ["down", 90.772, 91.164], ["it", 91.367, 91.436], ["was", 91.436, 91.559], ["waiting", 91.559, 91.844], ["for", 91.844, 91.959], ["one", 91.959, 92.198], ["word", 92.198, 92.636], ["would", 92.854, 92.969], ["you", 92.969, 93.077], ["say", 93.077, 93.446], ["hug", 93.597, 94.09]], "lines": [[0.0, 2.569, "In this town, every kid gets one magic seed."], [2.74, 5.143, "Every sprout gets measured. That's how strong it is."], [5.368, 8.575, "A bush is fifty. Our champion's oak is nine thousand."], [8.763, 10.14, "Mine's a dot. A one."], [10.316, 11.424, "It's broccoli for ants."], [11.694, 14.024, "And on Harvest Day, a rock troll came stomping."], [14.207, 16.461, "The troll didn't stop. It just squished the pie table."], [16.683, 19.018, "I had one idea. \"Hug him first,\" I whispered."], [19.233, 20.141, "My dot shot up."], [20.341, 22.397, "It grabbed the troll. Gently. Like a teddy."], [22.604, 24.102, "Nobody cheered. Nobody moved."], [24.317, 26.981, "Then my tree got measured. Nine thousand and one."], [27.281, 28.966, "A tiny seed grows when it's needed."], [29.137, 32.106, "It grew branches. Then blossoms. Then golden apples."], [32.334, 35.563, "The champion stared at his oak. Ten years, it was the tallest."], [35.747, 37.778, "Every bush in town leaned toward my tree."], [37.945, 40.344, "I pointed at the broken tables. My tree fixed them."], [40.542, 42.95, "Then it handed me an apple. From across the square."], [43.16, 46.244, "So the champion made me an offer. All his gold. For my tree."], [46.396, 48.814, "A tree. Or a mountain of gold. Which would you pick?"], [49.081, 52.329, "I kept my tree. \"But the troll can go,\" I said. \"Let go.\""], [52.56, 56.002, "Out rolled the troll. Giggling like a baby. Not one grump left."], [56.189, 58.066, "A tree hug squeezes out all the grumpy."], [58.271, 60.74, "Then the old garden keeper grabbed my arm. She was shaking."], [60.945, 65.176, "\"Tiny seeds don't listen,\" she said. \"Not to anyone. Not in a thousand years.\""], [65.406, 67.911, "\"It hugged when you said hug. It let go when you said so.\""], [68.16, 72.002, "A tiny seed can grow into anything. It just never does. That's why it's a one."], [72.237, 73.514, "Mine does. For me."], [73.724, 76.298, "Nobody ever woke a tiny seed. Until today."], [76.516, 78.876, "Then the giggling troll sniffled. One rumble."], [79.024, 80.27, "And a shadow covered the sun."], [80.47, 82.94, "Something stomped onto the hill. The hill looked small."], [83.105, 84.972, "Its mother. Nine hundred thousand."], [85.16, 86.829, "Nine thousand and one was a pebble."], [87.021, 88.783, "Everybody ran. My tree didn't."], [88.95, 91.164, "It bent its branches around me. And it looked down."], [91.367, 94.09, "It was waiting for one word. Would you say \"hug\"?"]]}